  /* ---- reserve level ------------------------------------------------ *
   * One object at three fill levels, for a set whose distinction is HOW
   * MUCH BUFFER YOU HOLD — working capital policy, aggressive through
   * conservative. The accent layer on these is the charge inside the
   * battery, so the card's own hue fills it in proportion: the empty one
   * draws no tone at all, which is the point being made.
   * -------------------------------------------------------------------- */
